            "repere": "Intertitre · “As a mom of three, I know the importa…",
            "text": "“As a mom of three, I know the importance of diet &amp; nutrition: not just for your own health, but the health of <span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:'Dutch801 Rm BT', serif\">future generations</span>. I also know how hard finding clean, reliable, nutrient support can be.<br><br>I founded Ritual with the belief that better health begins with better ingredients. With us, you’ll know where ingredients come from and why it’s there. Some call it obsessiveness, <span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:'Dutch801 Rm BT', serif\">we call it traceability.</span><br><br>It’s why Ritual works with leading scientists, researchers and advisors to create women’s health supplements that meet our highest standards for safety and quality, like Essential Prenatal Multivitamin: the #1 best-selling prenatal backed by its own human clinical trial.”",
